#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
Bamboo-UHPC bond-slip prediction system - single-file edition (English interface).

This one file contains everything: the local HTTP service, the English single-page
interface, the 27 calibrated cases and the 27 x 5 Origin point-by-point curves.
No data folder, no web folder, no pip package, no Origin/Excel/Node/Go - Python 3.8+
is enough.

Usage
-----
    python Bamboo_UHPC_EN_single.py                 # random port + browser
    python Bamboo_UHPC_EN_single.py --port 53710    # fixed port (paper / bookmark)
    python Bamboo_UHPC_EN_single.py --no-browser    # serve only, print the URL
    python Bamboo_UHPC_EN_single.py --export "out"  # CSV/XLSX/README, no GUI

The file is about 10 MB because the 25 MB Origin curve database is stored inside it as
zlib-compressed, base64-encoded text.  All user-facing text is English; the case codes
(UN-L50-D8), the symbols S/Su and tau/tau_u and every numeric value are identical to
the multi-file edition.
"""

